.Dd November 25, 2026
.Dt SL 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm sl
.Nd run a steam locomotive across your desktop to punish your typos
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl acdeFGlsw
.Op Fl Ns Ar n
.Op Fl -all
.Op Fl -model Ar file
.Op Fl -freeze Ar seconds
.Nm
.Fl v
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a highly advanced animation program for soothing your nerves after
typing
.Ic ls
wrong one too many times. A three-dimensional steam locomotive crosses
your entire desktop, over every open window, on every Space.
.Pp
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl a
An accident seems to happen. You feel pity for people who cry for help.
.It Fl c
A C51 locomotive appears instead of the D51.
.It Fl d
Disco mode.
.It Fl e
Allow interruption by Ctrl+C. Off by default, obviously.
.It Fl F
It flies like the Galaxy Express 999.
.It Fl G
A French TGV appears.
.It Fl l
A little version.
.It Fl s
Chuff and whistle. Silent by default.
.It Fl w
Windy. It moves faster.
.It Fl Ns Ar n
Pull Ar n trailing cars.
.It Fl -all
Traverse every connected display.
.It Fl -model Ar file
Load a .usdz, .scn or .dae locomotive instead of the built-in one.
.It Fl -freeze Ar seconds
Render one frozen frame and hold. For screenshots.
.It Fl v
Print version.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ls 1
.Sh BUGS
It sometimes lists directory contents.
